1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:58,410
Master !

25
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,570
I was hurt by someone !

26
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,250
Master, please avenge me !

27
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:16,050
Tell me what happened.

28
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,210
That prince's lackey escaped.

29
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,730
I was investigating, so I chased him.

30
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:22,730
I didn't think he would have strong backup.

31
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,570
He asked a mortal for help

32
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:25,810
and he injured me.

33
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,610
Master,

34
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,490
if Fu'er hadn't escaped in time,

35
00:02:29,950 --> 00:02:32,370
I'm afraid Master wouldn't have ever seen me again.

36
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,370
Are you sure

37
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,730
that when you saw this cultivator,

38
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,640
he had no spiritual energy

39
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,360
as if he were a mortal ?

40
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,490
I'm not mistaken !

41
00:02:43,450 --> 00:02:46,090
Otherwise, why would I think he's a mortal ?

42
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:52,370
Lead the way.

43
00:02:53,550 --> 00:02:54,930
No need to fly,

44
00:02:55,070 --> 00:02:56,450
we will walk.

45
00:02:57,030 --> 00:02:59,050
We haven't walked together in a long time.

46
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,730
See you, Master.

47
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:12,930
Master favors Junior Brother too much.

48
00:03:13,110 --> 00:03:14,170
Since he was a child,

49
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,400
when he got in trouble,

50
00:03:15,350 --> 00:03:17,320
Master would help him immediately.

51
00:03:17,870 --> 00:03:20,530
Over the years, he never refused him anything.

52
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,970
With Master's wisdom,

53
00:03:24,070 --> 00:03:26,850
how could he not understand what Junior Brother was doing ?

54
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:28,250
There must be something wrong.

55
00:03:28,670 --> 00:03:32,560
I wonder which sect the person who provoked Junior Brother belongs to.

56
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:35,370
I guess he must be at Core Formation

57
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:38,290
since he was able to beat Junior Brother.

58
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,450
With Master's standing in the Four Sect Alliance,

59
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:43,170
not to mention a Core Formation cultivator,

60
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:44,530
even a Nascent Soul cultivator

61
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,330
won't stand a chance.

62
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,690
You dared to provoke me.

63
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:57,000
I will make you pay for it with your life !

64
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,610
Candy animals !

65
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,610
Look, it's the candy maker.

66
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,410
How much for a candy ?

67
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,970
One copper coin is enough.

68
00:04:11,610 --> 00:04:13,890
Fu'er was born the year of the monkey,

69
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,810
of course I had to choose this one.

70
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:19,460
Do you like it ?

71
00:04:23,890 --> 00:04:26,410
When I first met you,

72
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:29,490
you were fighting with a bunch of kids over candies.

73
00:04:30,250 --> 00:04:32,410
Maybe you have already forgotten...

74
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,210
How could I forget ?

75
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,730
Fu'er lived a hard life.

76
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:36,930
If it weren't for Master,

77
00:04:37,090 --> 00:04:38,850
I'm afraid I'd be dead by now.

78
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,010
Let's go.

79
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:44,850
Take me to that person.

80
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,050
Tell me.

81
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:54,730
What happened ?

82
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,540
It's because of the Rain Cauldron.

83
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,690
The Rain Cauldron ?

84
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:02,050
The Crown Prince obtained a precious artifact

85
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,370
named the Rain Cauldron.

86
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,670
The law in the Four Sect Alliance

87
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:06,980
is to gift the Prince any Immortal artifact you find.

88
00:05:06,770 --> 00:05:09,770
The Crown Prince was betrayed in a moment of carelessness.

89
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,730
He had hidden the Rain Cauldron

90
00:05:11,650 --> 00:05:14,350
but it was discovered by Zhou Wutai of the White Cloud Sect.

91
00:05:14,340 --> 00:05:17,210
He ordered to kill the Crown Prince to bury the evidence.

92
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,930
The Crown Prince offered to give him the Rain Cauldron

93
00:05:20,740 --> 00:05:22,410
but he couldn't escape death.

94
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:24,610
The cultivators who supported us before

95
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:26,330
left us one by one.

96
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:28,410
I had no other choice

97
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:31,090
but to come and ask for help from Mister Wang.

98
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:37,290
I saved your life

99
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:40,890
to repay for your 16 years of commitment.

100
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,370
You can leave now.

101
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,530
Thank you for your kindness !

102
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:50,650
I will remember it forever.

103
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,170
Come back in.

104
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,010
We have guests.

105
00:06:02,660 --> 00:06:03,490
Master,

106
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,170
it's him !

107
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,090
He's the one who hurt me !

108
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,410
Fellow cultivator,

109
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:29,890
how about we have a drink ?

110
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,810
Sounds good ?

111
00:06:41,850 --> 00:06:43,010
Good wine !

112
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,370
Since you like it,

113
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:49,810
I'll gift you the rest of that jug.

114
00:06:53,370 --> 00:06:57,130
Fellow cultivator's cultivation level is much higher than mine.

115
00:06:57,920 --> 00:07:01,490
I admire you for living like a mortal to turn into a mortal.

116
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:06,010
Fellow cultivator is turning into a mortal

117
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:09,740
by using the teacher-disciple emotion to understand the heavens.

118
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:12,210
Your result is the same as mine,

119
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:14,890
you don't have to admire me.

120
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:18,730
It seems I was not wrong.

121
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,250
When I heard my disciple,

122
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:23,800
I guessed there was someone in the same realm as me

123
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,530
that is trying to reach Soul Formation.

124
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:31,290
Why don't you and I have a competition ?

125
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:37,610
Let's see who will reach the mythical Soul Formation realm first.

126
00:07:37,940 --> 00:07:39,010
Interested ?

127
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:46,290
If I feel a sense of competition in my heart,

128
00:07:46,060 --> 00:07:49,410
I'm afraid I will never reach Soul Formation in my life.

129
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,650
Fellow cultivator,

130
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,770
your words are

131
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,970
very vicious.

132
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,410
I didn't expect to meet

133
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:04,770
a cultivator of your caliber here.

134
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,650
I am Zhou Wutai.

135
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:09,050
I wonder what fellow cultivator's name is.

136
00:08:10,610 --> 00:08:11,870
Wang Lin.

137
00:08:11,810 --> 00:08:12,970
Fellow cultivator Wang.

138
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,570
Within a hundred years,

139
00:08:14,330 --> 00:08:16,410
you will definitely reach Soul Formation !

140
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:19,250
I will congratulate you early today.

141
00:08:24,540 --> 00:08:26,650
Another vicious word attack.

142
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:29,410
If these words plant a seed in my heart,

143
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,930
it will be a curse for a hundred years.

144
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:34,330
As the years pass and I fail to reach Soul Formation,

145
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:36,690
I will slowly lose my chance to breakthrough

146
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,890
if I don't have a sudden enlightenment.

147
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:42,050
Fellow cultivator Zhou is speaking prematurely,

148
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:44,170
From my point of view,

149
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:47,140
whether fellow cultivator Zhou can reach Soul Formation

150
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:48,370
is uncertain.

151
00:08:48,930 --> 00:08:50,290
But your disciple

152
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:52,810
will definitely die

153
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:55,090
within a hundred years.

154
00:09:06,250 --> 00:09:08,130
Mister Wang has a sharp tongue.

155
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:10,340
But if he makes Zhou Wutai angry...

156
00:09:10,180 --> 00:09:11,930
what will happen ?

157
00:09:12,610 --> 00:09:15,290
He saw through my relation with Fu'er,

158
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:17,470
that I'm acting as his teacher and father.

159
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:23,780
This person is understanding the heavens

160
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:26,000
through the teacher-disciple releationship

161
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:27,170
to form his domain.

162
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:28,690
He raised him with his love,

163
00:09:29,020 --> 00:09:30,580
his kindness to give him favor,

164
00:09:30,380 --> 00:09:32,220
his heart to love him.

165
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:34,250
But he is plagued with sorrow.

166
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,530
Because everything he has done,

167
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:38,330
is for the sake of

168
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:40,250
his teacher-disciple realationship.

169
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:43,460
But the day he will finally form his domain,

170
00:09:43,260 --> 00:09:45,700
when he will be about to reach Soul Formation

171
00:09:45,890 --> 00:09:48,730
will be the day he has to kill his disciple himself.

172
00:09:49,290 --> 00:09:52,490
By killing the disciple he placed all his heart in,

173
00:09:52,710 --> 00:09:55,260
the sorrow will fill his whole being

174
00:09:55,090 --> 00:09:58,000
while he takes that last step and reaches Soul Formation.

175
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,190
This person's domain

176
00:09:59,330 --> 00:10:00,680
appears emotionate

177
00:10:00,530 --> 00:10:02,090
but is ruthless.

178
00:10:02,340 --> 00:10:04,370
Yet amidst that ruthlessness,

179
00:10:04,290 --> 00:10:07,170
is the emotion of true love.

180
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:10,130
By bringing the hundred year limit,

181
00:10:10,770 --> 00:10:14,730
he exposed my true ruthless nature

182
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:17,210
and the sadness I will feel in the future.

183
00:10:17,820 --> 00:10:19,970
At the same time,

184
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:23,130
he left a mark in Fu'er's heart.

185
00:10:23,970 --> 00:10:25,610
He saw through me

186
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:30,370
but I didn't get a single clue about his domain.

187
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,610
He's clever...

188
00:10:32,990 --> 00:10:34,020
Very clever.

189
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,160
Tell your king

190
00:10:37,540 --> 00:10:40,490
to send the Rain Cauldron to my temple in 3 days.

191
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,130
And I

192
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:43,970
won't pursue this matter.

193
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,610
Master !

194
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,930
But your disciple

195
00:10:57,010 --> 00:10:59,090
will definitely die

196
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:01,610
within a hundred years.

197
00:11:13,410 --> 00:11:14,370
Fu'er,

198
00:11:14,410 --> 00:11:15,850
don't think about it too much.

199
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:18,210
Why didn't you eat the candy ?

200
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:20,580
Master gifted it to me

201
00:11:20,370 --> 00:11:22,050
so I plan to keep it forever.

202
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:31,490
This person shall be my lifelong rival.

203
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:37,130
I knew that Mister Wang was an expert !

204
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,370
The White Cloud Sect cultivators

205
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:41,730
didn't dare to help us anymore

206
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:44,450
and the Crown Prince was killed.

207
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,290
But with a few words,

208
00:11:48,160 --> 00:11:50,730
he made this cultivator comply.

209
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,610
The Desperate Emotions Domain...

210
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,370
The Comfort Domain...

211
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,850
The Passing of Time Domain...

212
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,250
What will

213
00:12:08,560 --> 00:12:10,490
my domain be ?

214
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:22,660
5 years later

215
00:12:31,530 --> 00:12:32,610
Shopkeeper Wang.

216
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:34,730
Shopkeeper Wang.

217
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:38,130
Mother.

218
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:42,530
Widow Ceng Si,

219
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:44,660
greets Brother Wang.

220
00:12:44,420 --> 00:12:45,730
Condolences.

221
00:12:52,820 --> 00:12:53,810
Brother,

222
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:55,090
excuse him.

223
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:56,570
The kid doesn't understand.

224
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,010
Brother,

225
00:12:58,040 --> 00:12:59,210
if you don't mind,

226
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:00,610
come over for a meal.

227
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:12,570
Uncle Wang...

228
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:32,260
You're not a cultivator

229
00:13:32,380 --> 00:13:35,100
so you have to enter the reincarnation cycle.

230
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:38,010
This flower will help your soul in the Reincarnation River

231
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,370
to find a good family.

232
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:51,050
Grandpa ?

233
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,290
What is this place ?

234
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:41,660
I cannot believe someone on this waste of a planet

235
00:14:41,460 --> 00:14:44,610
can comprehend such a profound Dao.

236
00:14:41,370 --> 00:14:44,580
The All-Seer
Tian Yunzi

237
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:49,170
But with your mere Nascent Soul cultivation,

238
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,890
it's best not to be too greedy.

239
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:54,330
This kind of heavenly Dao

240
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:58,410
it will take you millions of years to find its source.

241
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:03,450
But your body will already have rotted away.

242
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:06,330
Have you thought of that ?

243
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,610
I am the All-Seer.

244
00:15:14,160 --> 00:15:16,410
Since we met, let's make a deal.

245
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:20,010
If you can get off this waste of a planet

246
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:24,940
then come find me on planet Tian Yun to become my honorary disciple

247
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:27,290
and follow me for 100 years.

248
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:30,170
Go back.

249
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:42,650
If it weren't for the All-Seer pushing me back,

250
00:15:43,310 --> 00:15:45,050
I would have lost myself

251
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:47,690
to search for the source of the Dao of the reincarnation cycle.

252
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:31,250
I did it !

253
00:16:29,970 --> 00:16:33,320
Wang Lin's avatar
Peak Late stage Nascent Soul

254
00:16:41,450 --> 00:16:43,900
After thinking so much, I understand.

255
00:16:44,420 --> 00:16:45,930
The passing of time

256
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:48,850
is just an imitation of the reincarnation cycle

257
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,930
but it's not like a real reincarnation.

258
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:58,970
I still need to pursue my own domain.

259
00:17:03,210 --> 00:17:04,690
Soul Formation...

260
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,890
I, Wang Lin,

261
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:09,730
will definitely reach it.

262
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:16,690
The days of the mortal world always go by quickly.

263
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:19,770
To improve his blacksmith business

264
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:21,850
Da Niu annexed 3 other shops nearby.

265
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:23,290
He is thriving.

266
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:27,010
Da Niu also violated his family's rule

267
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:30,890
by passing on his skills to other people, and have them work for him.

268
00:17:31,010 --> 00:17:31,710
Dad,

269
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:33,050
I don't want to be a blacksmith.

270
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:34,780
I want to learn wood carving !

271
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:37,090
You cannot even hold a forge hammer properly,

272
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:39,700
yet you want to do fine work like Uncle Wang ?

273
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:42,650
You little rascal !

274
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:44,890
Ouch, it hurts.

275
00:17:45,570 --> 00:17:46,530
Uncle Wang,

276
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,490
I won't bring you wine today.

277
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:51,730
You are getting old, you can't drink every day.

278
00:18:05,890 --> 00:18:09,180
6 years later

279
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,330
Be careful.

280
00:18:24,110 --> 00:18:24,950
Immortal,

281
00:18:25,390 --> 00:18:26,490
thank you for coming.

282
00:18:27,210 --> 00:18:28,010
Kid,

283
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:29,210
come here.

284
00:18:39,580 --> 00:18:41,050
Excellent bones,

285
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:42,860
his body is made to cultivate.

286
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:45,130
Will you let me take him in as my disciple ?

287
00:18:45,020 --> 00:18:46,050
Of course.

288
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:46,570
Gladly !

289
00:18:46,380 --> 00:18:47,410
Of course !

290
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,130
Xiao Niu,

291
00:18:51,450 --> 00:18:53,760
it doesn't matter if you don't become an Immortal.

292
00:18:53,590 --> 00:18:55,570
You can always come back home !

293
00:19:12,420 --> 00:19:13,830
It's snowing !

294
00:19:13,770 --> 00:19:14,930
It's snowing !

295
00:19:15,290 --> 00:19:16,450
It's getting too cold.

296
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:19,580
How could it be snowing at this time of the year ?

297
00:19:17,550 --> 00:19:19,800
When it snows, New Year is near !

298
00:19:20,700 --> 00:19:21,610
Go back home,

299
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:22,530
stop playing outside.

300
00:19:22,780 --> 00:19:24,090
But it's great !

301
00:19:24,340 --> 00:19:25,810
And they're gone...

302
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,060
This isn't normal snow.

303
00:19:36,730 --> 00:19:38,290
It has killing intent ?

304
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,770
Yay it's thundering !

305
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:56,330
When I grow up I want to be an Immortal too.

306
00:19:56,080 --> 00:19:57,810
Immortals are so powerful !

307
00:19:57,560 --> 00:19:59,250
A thunder spell ?

308
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:13,580
There's a huge restriction here ?

309
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:31,490
What the hell ?!

310
00:20:46,870 --> 00:23:33,750
The reincarnation cycle stems from the daoist belief that birth is not the beginning and that death is not the end. When a person dies, their soul leaves their body and enters the Yellow Springs, also known as the underworld, and takes the Reincarnation River to be reborn.
Life and death in a world governed by the reincarnation cycle are just steps of the soul's journey. Moving on to the next life is just a natural part of the law of the heavens.

311
00:20:55,250 --> 00:20:59,380
I've had my share of wounds,

312
00:20:57,290 --> 00:20:59,380
now I want to fight back.

313
00:20:59,210 --> 00:21:02,940
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

314
00:21:02,770 --> 00:21:08,860
that's blocking all my hopes

315
00:21:05,650 --> 00:21:08,860
for life ?

316
00:21:10,410 --> 00:21:14,620
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

317
00:21:12,130 --> 00:21:14,620
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

318
00:21:14,690 --> 00:21:18,020
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

319
00:21:18,130 --> 00:21:24,020
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

320
00:21:20,850 --> 00:21:24,020
out of reach.

321
00:21:25,130 --> 00:21:29,500
Immortals

322
00:21:26,170 --> 00:21:29,500
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

323
00:21:29,530 --> 00:21:33,540
Renegades

324
00:21:30,290 --> 00:21:33,540
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

325
00:21:33,290 --> 00:21:37,380
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

326
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:37,380
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

327
00:21:37,370 --> 00:21:41,500
because I don't see the harm in that.

328
00:21:43,250 --> 00:21:49,300
My new body opens its eyes

329
00:21:45,770 --> 00:21:49,300
and awakens from its dream.

330
00:21:49,170 --> 00:21:56,860
I have overcome many trials

331
00:21:51,290 --> 00:21:56,860
to get this body back.

332
00:21:56,810 --> 00:22:04,500
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

333
00:22:00,850 --> 00:22:04,500
I can still see.

334
00:22:04,650 --> 00:22:13,860
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

335
00:22:08,610 --> 00:22:13,860
by my own hands.

336
00:22:44,490 --> 00:22:50,700
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

337
00:22:47,210 --> 00:22:50,700
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

338
00:22:50,450 --> 00:22:58,260
With a flick of a finger,

339
00:22:51,890 --> 00:22:58,260
only my indomitable heart remains.

340
00:22:58,050 --> 00:23:07,660
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

341
00:23:04,010 --> 00:23:07,660
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

342
00:23:07,650 --> 00:23:15,500
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

343
00:23:10,170 --> 00:23:15,500
like the descent of a god.
